  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Research- Population Council</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this component the interventions will be periodically evaluated to get the greatest value for money and build a mechanism of regular feedback for timely course correction. Together, these actions are expected to expedite fertility decline in Pakistan in the next four years contributing to DAFPAK overall impact. They will produce quality research and implementation science results, consideration important dimensions of the climate crisis, such as demographics, prepare high-level communication and advocacy products, strengthening data systems by demonstrating their analytic aspects and evaluate &amp; monitor DAFPAK components. Implementing Partners: Population Council</narrative>
  </description>
